      "writtenOn": "2017-02-16T20:22:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For these _chip.h headers, it is assumed that they will only live in the chip folder, so we\u0027re using pathless guards. See init_chip.h and system_chip.h in chip/g/ for example, and other board/*/system_chip.h files, for example.",
